	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r03_list_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ねえねえ　ねえねえ
せいそくちリスト　みせて！▼
３ばんどうろの　ポケモン　ぜんぶだよ
くさむらも　つりも　みずのうえも！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T03:37:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T07:24:01" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ねえねえ　ねえねえ
生息地リスト　みせて！▼
３番道路の　ポケモン　全部だよ
草むらも　つりも　水上も！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
