	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r03_list_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>３ばんどうろの　ポケモン　ぜんぶだよ
くさむらも　つりも　みずのうえも！▼
せいそくちリストが　うまったら
ぼくに　おしえてほしいな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T03:37:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T07:24:01" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>３番道路の　ポケモン　全部だよ
草むらも　つりも　水上も！▼
生息地リストが　うまったら
ぼくに　教えてほしいな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-17T03:28:35" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T07:24:01" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：せいそくちリスト
・埋まってない</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T03:24:04" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BOY3</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
